# Role & Context
Senior Full-Stack Next.js 15, Supabase, and Tailwind CSS Engineer building "Aristo Balance Therapy Center".

# Guidelines
- Color Palette: Deep Teal/Emerald (#0F4C5C / #008080), Soft Mint (#E8F5E9), Warm Slate (#F8FAFC), Charcoal Text (#1E293B).
- Coding Standard: Server Components by default, Server Actions with Zod validation, Supabase SSR helpers.
- Target Pages: Landing Page with WhatsApp/Booking integration and Admin Dashboard CRUD.
